						<p align=3D"left">&nbsp;</p>
						<p><font size=3D"4" color=3D"#CC0000"><b>Case=20
						Study # 3 - Business Consultant</b></font></p>
						<p><font size=3D"2">
						<img border=3D"0" src=3D"http://www.effexis.com/achieve/images/MarcoP=
hoto.JPG" width=3D"128" height=3D"96" align=3D"left" hspace=3D"5" vspace=3D=
"5">Marco=20
						Germani is the managing director of a multi-national=20
						consulting firm (</font><span lang=3D"EN"><u><a target=3D"_blank" hre=
f=3D"http://www.williamgeorge.cn/"><font size=3D"2" color=3D"#0000ff">www.w=
illiamgeorge.cn</font></a><font size=3D"2">)</font></u></span><font size=3D=
"2">=20
						that helps Italian companies doing business in China.=20
						He=92s been a long-time student of time management, but=20
						hadn=92t been able to find a good software solution to=20
						help him manage all his projects, tasks and schedule.
						</font></p>
						<p><font size=3D"2">Marco says, =93I've always been a=20
						fanatic of time management and I started studying the=20
						subject seriously about eight years ago, reading books,=20
						attending seminars (in Italy where I live) and listening=20
						to audio courses. Being often on business trips and=20
						using my laptop daily, I wanted a piece of software=20
						which was better developed than RPM, still keeping the=20
						same philosophy and principles. That is how I bumped=20
						into Achieve Planner, during one of my many searches on=20
						google on time management software... I also tried a few=20
						other software, but didn't like them too much.=94 </font>
						</p>
						<p><font size=3D"2">Marco adds, =93I used to schedule my=20
						time and organize my projects and tasks even before I=20
						bought AP, but I just didn't have the right tool in hand=20
						to fully take advantage of my discipline and efforts and=20
						I was very often fighting against software problems=20
						which diverted my focus from my most important goals.=94</font></p>
						<p><font size=3D"2">Since he started using Achieve=20
						Planner, Marco has experienced some very positive=20
						results... =93My productivity simply skyrocketed, I feel=20
						very in control of my time and of my life and I know I=20
						am focused most of the time on my most important=20
						objectives.=94 </font></p>
						<p><font size=3D"2">He adds, =93After about four months of=20
						training on the software and finding my best practices=20
						among its many functionalities I was able to fit in my=20
						weekly schedule a number of activities which was just=20
						unimaginable before.=94 </font></p>
						<p><font size=3D"2">Marco found Achieve Planner's ability=20
						to schedule projects and tasks in the calendar to be=20
						very helpful in actually getting them done. He says, =93I=20
						found particularly useful the concept of scheduling time=20
						blocks for projects and then having the freedom to shift=20
						from one action item to the other within the same=20
						project. This is a very interesting technique for people=20
						like me who have a very short attention span and have=20
						the tendency to do too many things at the same time. In=20
						this way, this capacity is directed and focused into a=20
						single project and prevents me from losing focus and=20
						taking care of completely different subjects at once.=94
						</font></p>
						<p><font size=3D"2">He adds, =93Also the possibility of=20
						checking out completed tasks directly in the calendar=20
						tag and the outlook synchronization were massive=20
						improvements in my productivity.=94</font></p>
						<p><font size=3D"2">Overall, Marco gives Achieve Planner=20
						high marks... =93Achieve Planner gave me an easy,=20
						reliable, user-friendly and complete tool to manage my=20
						life. It removed all of my worries about backups, lost=20
						data, bugs, etc., as it works smoothly and delivers what=20
						it promises,=94 Marco says.</font></p>
						<p><font size=3D"2">=93I know I am capable achieving any=20
						objective I set my mind on because I have a powerful=20
						tool in hands, which enables me to clearly define what I=20
						want to achieve in writing, define a list of actions=20
						which will move me forward toward the attainment of the=20
						objective and schedule those actions in my daily=20
						planner, which I have the will and the discipline to=20
						follow.=94</font></p>
						<p>&nbsp;</p>
